    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Poon Puzzle\ud83e\udde9 - the best puzzle game! </strong></h2>Get ready for an awesome time in Poon Puzzle, where you'll solve puzzles with cute horny girls!  Are you ready to have fun?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587890/extras/b7332196b97031fa2ea1e3774e9f3195.poster.avif?t=1737108544\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587890/extras/b7332196b97031fa2ea1e3774e9f3195.webm?t=1737108544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587890/extras/b7332196b97031fa2ea1e3774e9f3195.mp4?t=1737108544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Gameplay Mechanics</h2></strong>Unlike all other jigsaw puzzle games, Poon Puzzle features an original, polygonal mechanics: assemble animated girls from various polygons. Rotating and flipping them also makes the gameplay much more fun.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587890/extras/fb2b357f0fbedab91abec156fc6019c5.avif?t=1737108544\" width=600 height=465 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High resolution animations of hot girls to enjoy</strong></h2>As you progress through the levels, you'll encounter new and more intricate puzzles that will test your skills and keep you engaged. With a variety of intricate animated artworks to discover, leave all your worries behind and immerse yourself in the beautiful world of Poon Puzzle. Enjoy a wonderful animations in 4K resolution.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Vibrant Art: Enjoy stunning visuals featuring a colorful cast of characters.<br></li><li>Engaging Puzzles: Test your puzzle-solving skills with a lot of levels.<br></li><li>Simple Gameplay: Poon Puzzle intuitive gameplay ensures that even those new to the genre will feel right at home.<br></li><li>Achievements: Showcase your puzzle prowess by unlocking various achievements.<br></li><li>Relaxing Music: Immerse yourself in the soothing soundtrack that perfectly complements the charming atmosphere of Poon Puzzle, helping you unwind and focus on solving the puzzles.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587890/extras/3c1c5d5b4218cc6bed82803850d037ed.avif?t=1737108544\" width=640 height=445 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start your awesome puzzle adventure now </h2></strong>Don't miss out on the most fun and addictive puzzle game! Jump into Poon Puzzle and start your amazing adventure today! \ud83e\udd29<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please don't forget to add Poon Puzzle to your wishlist\ud83e\udde1! </h2></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587890/extras/add_to_wishlist_EN.GIF?t=1737108544\" width=640 height=445 /></span>",
